From: dotfiles D3 investigation
Subject: [PATCH] Honor Ultra header-v1 and request temperature

Reference: https://huggingface.co/vllm-sr/d3-ultra/tree/52ba9e7a00402f9560c7fba8c039608e7ddee7fb
Reference-files: d3_format.py, d3_runtime.py

PR62584 predates Ultra. Its prefix mask alone does not implement Ultra's
question-list header and calibrated per-request temperature. Do not mutate
strategy temperature across concurrent requests. Media requests keep the
checkpoint's header-free path. Box/Track remain a native-runtime surface.

